# RefactorGPT Tools – Cursor rules

Prompt/guidelines sources (in order): AGENTS.md, .cursorrules, REFACTOR.md.

Project: Ruby CLI tools for refactoring (refactor_gpt.rb), code search (ag_gpt.rb), bash generation (bash_gpt.rb), Q&A (ask_gpt.rb), git commit (git_commit_gpt.rb), superagent TUI (superagent.rb). Shared code in lib/; superagent in lib/superagent/ (config_path.rb → ~/.config/superagent). Tests in test/.
